# Pinned scanner versions for the daily security workflow.
# Reconfirmed 2026-11-13 from upstream release checksums and registry manifests.
# GitHub Actions cron cannot express Europe/London. See README.md.
# Download with curl -fsSL. A redirect body is not the binary.

