# The floating latest tag points at the 1.184.0 index digest sha256:cc1b68266f267878b39739373ea9985b9a78e5d64497dd875c8de100b22695ed. Do not use it.
SEMGREP_IMAGE=semgrep/semgrep:1.185.0@sha256:67518c174185a2043fdbed16c70631b79209499b3671178e7194379b48295a0d
# ghcr.io/zaproxy/zaproxy:stable index digest, reconfirmed unchanged on 2026-11-13.
# The latest tag on GHCR points at the same index.
# zap.sh -version and the baseline report @version, both executed on 2026-11-11 against this same digest, reported 2.17.0.
# Upstream release v2.17.0, published 2025-12-15, is still the current stable release on 2026-11-13.
# An older index, sha256:030d3df57735dacbb83464854758e674dd9ad01d79d12a129a8e58b1fd384238, is still fetchable by digest and is not the stable tag.
